Flow Designer Transpiler v2.7
---------------------------------------------
A system prompt that teaches a model to write
ServiceNow Flow Designer flows as update-set
XML. Each rule has a tag that says how far
it was checked: run, imported or only seen.
Tools, fixtures and test imports included.
Tested on personal developer instances only.
